tools/zig-pkg/

# Unpacked CRXes, deobfuscated snapshots, and the checker's scratch trees.
#
# These are the baseline each run diffs the next release against, so they do
# have to survive between runs — but not in git. Twenty-eight vendor bundles,
# rewritten twice a week, would grow this repository without bound and bury
# every real change under a wall of regenerated output. The workflow carries
# them across runs through the Actions cache instead; see the "Restore
# extension snapshots" step in .github/workflows/check-filter-patches.yml.
extensions/
